{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"のおおおおお\nやっぱしみなさんに心配かけて\nしまってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調崩してはないから大丈夫よ！\n元気です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はオフだったので昼まで寝て\nお布団干してバニラヨーグルト食べて\n掃除して宿題してました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまちゃん♡2012.12.29"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもメンバーを引っ張ってくれて\nありがとう！\nいつもありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒を見てると、\n人に頼らず自分で頑張らないとな\nって思います。\nしゃんとしてる生駒、\n本当にかっこいいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒とおふざけするの楽しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この変態っ！ってくらい\n触ってくるけどね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきだよ！\n今の髪型いっちゃん好みです。\nまたなでなでさせてください。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクするとき\n一番気合いいれてるのはどこ(^o^)/？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肌と唇。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最もliveで張り切るメンバーは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは私も含め...\nみんなや！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニーキャラのなかで\n何が一番好きですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンボとバンビと白雪姫。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学と高校はセーラー？ブレザー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブレザーだよぉ。動きにくいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"推し変してもいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...寂しいです。だいぶ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また好きになって\nもらえるように頑張る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲数増えてきてダンスの振り付け\n忘れていったりしない？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。やっぱりライブ前は\nやった振り付けもきっちりやるよ。\nメンバー同士で教えあったりね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題はもうすませたかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"数学が終わらない～泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服の着丈とかサイズ感気にします？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事！\n大き過ぎても着られてる感\n出ちゃうからね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうじするとかはどこから始める？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目についたものから！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木詩のフリも結構揃ってたと\n思わない？ステージ上から\n見たらどんな感じなんだろう。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"揃ってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブでいつも感動します。\n舞台から見てると\n綺麗過ぎて鳥肌たつ！\n同じ動きしてると一体感が出て\n楽しいし嬉しいです^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクエスト7\n伊藤ちゃんずで遠近法\n(ねねが大きく見えるように)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン着だから脱力感満載だ。\nタノシー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/29/8253879/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}